 "remarks": "Beautiful home in Cos Cob, built in 2017 and maintained immaculately, featuring 10-foot ceilings on the first floor with gorgeous moldings, high-end custom cabinets with Carrara marble counters in the kitchen and butler's pantry. Luxury Wolf, Milie, and Sub-Zero appliances, plus tankless, on-demand hot water and a natural gas generator. Situated on nearly one-quarter acre of level lot convenient to central Cos Cob and walking distance to train station and shops. One-car garage plus carport, with car charger hookup installed. Fully finished basement with full bathroom, bedroom or office, TV room, and gym.",
